    <pubDate>Wed, 25 Dec 2024 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="33">00:33</a> 介绍来宾与主题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> 《寒暄》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">05:20</a> 进入正题！“被看见”，从主持聊起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">15:20</a> 如果你有了孩子你会鼓励ta“被看见”吗？我们看《好东西》的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1395">23:15</a> 对生活中的朋友圈“被看见” 的探讨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2185">36:25</a> 生活中很难“被看见”的情绪与心思，我们怎么做&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2730">45:30</a> 我的“炸鸡论”与短期“想得到”的讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3063">51:03</a> 你的长期“想得到”是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3236">53:56</a> 给思思的小小“脑洞”题 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3577">59:37</a> ending</span></p><span></span><p><span>提前感谢你的倾听！&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqhk6ea0y06sFAnKEt7x0OZR3YIC.m4a" length="59007454" type="audio/mp4"/>
